 "rule": {
  "selection": "the equal-cell mean BODY \u0394E over the term's calibration and control cells jointly, so that a trade is measured rather than assumed",
  "refusalRule": "a rung is REFUSED if any single control cell's body \u0394E exceeds twice its baseline reading at the frozen G1 endpoint. A mean absorbs one destroyed cell; the per-cell cap is the same instrument \u00a75.134 \u00a76's clause 3 is, applied at the fit stage instead of the scoring stage. If no rung both lowers the calibration cells and clears the cap, the FORM is refused and reported, and the exported document does not move for that term.",
  "published": "every rung's full per-cell table \u2014 full-canvas \u0394E, body \u0394E, body Y web/native, body SD \u2014 whether the rung is selected, refused or neither"
 },
